00:05:23.702 --> 00:05:24.535 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay, that's gross.

00:05:24.535 --> 00:05:25.368 line:92%
But, do you take anything else?

00:05:25.368 --> 00:05:26.201 line:92%
- [Whitney] Well, you do have to be careful

00:05:26.201 --> 00:05:28.160 line:92%
in the airport when a microphone goes through TSA,

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.350 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs)

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.429 line:92%
a lot of times, they don't know it's a microphone!

00:05:31.429 --> 00:05:34.480 line:92%
(audience laughs and claps)

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.437 line:92%
So, you really have to stop and be like,

00:05:37.437 --> 00:05:40.407 line:92%
"This does not vibrate, it's not battery op--

00:05:40.407 --> 00:05:42.690 line:92%
"That is a microphone, I swear!"

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.869 line:92%
- You're like, "But if it did vibrate..."

00:05:44.869 --> 00:05:45.702 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs)

00:05:45.702 --> 00:05:46.940 line:92%
- [Whitney] Yeah, I mean look, if they make that product,

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.153 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I'm not gonna freak out!

00:05:49.186 --> 00:05:50.650 line:92%
- Yeah, that's your problem!

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.069 line:92%
- [Whitney] Call Shark Tank, by the way!

00:05:52.069 --> 00:05:53.790 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs and claps)

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.908 size:78% position:39% line:92%
- Mark Cuban, listen!

00:05:54.908 --> 00:05:56.010 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs)

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.490 line:92%
So, I hear you love Nashville.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.630 line:92%
You love stopping in Nashville.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.190 line:92%
- [Whitney] I'm obsessed with Nashville!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.829 line:92%
I'm gonna be in Nashville on the tour.

00:06:01.829 --> 00:06:02.662 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:05.589 line:92%
- I love going to Nashville because of the vintage stores.

00:06:05.589 --> 00:06:06.422 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:06:06.422 --> 00:06:07.940 line:92%
- They have the best vintage shopping.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.230 line:92%
But I think I might stop doing it,

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:11.990 line:92%
'cause last time I went, I got this awesome denim jacket.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:14.030 line:92%
It had all these patches on it and pins.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:15.450 line:92%
And I wore it all the time on Instagram.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:18.840 line:92%
I have a horse and I ride my horse in this jacket.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.030 line:92%
And I loved it so much, and I got this DM one day,

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.257 line:92%
from this guy who was like,

00:06:23.257 --> 00:06:26.537 line:92%
"Hey, my ex got mad at me and sold

00:06:26.537 --> 00:06:29.210 line:92%
"a bunch of my stuff to a vintage store."

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.820 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience gasps)

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:32.858 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I think you have--

00:06:32.858 --> 00:06:34.120 line:92%
- First of all, that's awesome!

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:34.957 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- I know!

00:06:34.957 --> 00:06:35.880 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.530 line:92%
- How have I not thought of that?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.030 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That is amazing!

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:42.800 line:92%
You're trashing your stuff, plus making profit!

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:43.850 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Totally!

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:47.650 line:92%
This woman is an entrepreneur and she sounds awesome!

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.500 line:92%
And so, he said, "Can I have it back?"

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.640 line:92%
And I was like, "Yeah, I guess."

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:51.473 line:92%
So I sent it back to him.

00:06:51.473 --> 00:06:53.706 line:92%
- [Kelly] Did you tell him, "For this amount of money,"?

00:06:53.706 --> 00:06:54.539 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- I know!

00:06:54.539 --> 00:06:55.410 size:81% position:41% line:92%
- I mean, I bought it!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.800 line:92%
Sorry, she's a turd, but...

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.150 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- [Whitney] I know!

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.510 line:92%
So that, and then the other thing about going to the South,

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:03.310 line:92%
is I'm still trying to figure out what everything means.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.450 line:92%
And you could probably help me

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.090 line:92%
with the Southern colloquialisms.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:06.923 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Yes.

00:07:06.923 --> 00:07:09.186 line:92%
What does, "Bless your heart," mean?

00:07:09.186 --> 00:07:10.019 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience chuckles)

00:07:10.019 --> 00:07:10.997 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Mm, mm.

00:07:10.997 --> 00:07:12.208 line:92%
- Does it, it means you're stupid!

00:07:12.208 --> 00:07:13.041 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience chuckles)

00:07:13.041 --> 00:07:17.030 line:92%
- Well, there's like, it depends on the tone.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:17.863 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- [Whitney] Yeah!

00:07:17.863 --> 00:07:18.696 line:92%
- And who you're saying it to.

00:07:18.696 --> 00:07:19.910 line:92%
- [Whitney] Okay, so when I go to the South,

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.267 line:92%
they'll ask me where I'm from and I'm like,

00:07:21.267 --> 00:07:22.100 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"I live in L.A."

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:22.933 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And they're like,

00:07:22.933 --> 00:07:24.131 line:92%
- Bless your heart. - "Bless your heart."

00:07:24.131 --> 00:07:27.798 line:92%
(audience laughs and claps)

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.595 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Or it's like--

00:07:30.595 --> 00:07:31.500 line:92%
- [Whitney] What does that mean?

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.832 line:92%
- It's... well it's not a compliment sometimes.

00:07:33.832 --> 00:07:35.739 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:07:35.739 --> 00:07:39.281 line:92%
It's a Southerner's way of being shady.

00:07:39.281 --> 00:07:40.114 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Yeah!

00:07:40.114 --> 00:07:41.130 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs)

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:42.523 line:92%
- But doesn't it sound nice?

00:07:42.523 --> 00:07:45.010 line:92%
It's like British people cursing you out.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.363 line:92%
It sounds nice. - That is so true!

00:07:46.363 --> 00:07:48.002 line:92%
- It's like, you know it's rude, but I like it.

00:07:48.002 --> 00:07:48.835 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:07:48.835 --> 00:07:49.668 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Yeah!

00:07:49.668 --> 00:07:50.640 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Yeah.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.232 line:92%
- And then I learned the hard way that when a woman

00:07:53.232 --> 00:07:57.200 line:92%
in the South says she's, "Fixin' to pitch a fit,"

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.097 line:92%
- I'm fixin' to pitch a fit, yes.

00:07:58.097 --> 00:07:59.110 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Get out of there!

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.188 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Yeah.

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:01.021 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Get out of there!

00:08:01.021 --> 00:08:02.430 line:92%
Yup, and grab anything that belongs to you,

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.523 line:92%
'cause she'll sell it, too!

00:08:03.523 --> 00:08:06.900 line:92%
(audience laughs and claps)

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:07.820 size:84% position:42% line:92%
A Southern woman knows.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.310 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She's smart.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:13.622 line:92%
- And then also, is tea sweet already?

00:08:13.622 --> 00:08:16.455 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.356 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- No!

00:08:18.356 --> 00:08:21.677 line:92%
- If you want tea that's sweet, you just say,

00:08:21.677 --> 00:08:23.530 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"I'd like some tea."

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.363 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- [Kelly] Well,

00:08:24.363 --> 00:08:25.810 line:92%
- But what if you don't want sweet tea?

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:26.643 size:88% position:44% line:92%
- No, I've always been--

00:08:26.643 --> 00:08:27.740 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Bless my heart?

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.917 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Bless your heart!

00:08:28.917 --> 00:08:31.113 line:92%
(audience laughs and claps)

00:08:31.113 --> 00:08:31.946 line:92%
- [Kelly] You know what, though?

00:08:31.946 --> 00:08:32.779 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm different.

00:08:32.779 --> 00:08:34.040 line:92%
I don't really do sweet tea anymore.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:34.873 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- [Whitney] Okay.

00:08:34.873 --> 00:08:36.030 line:92%
- Yeah, I just fell in love with hot tea.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:36.863 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Okay,

00:08:36.863 --> 00:08:38.180 line:92%
- All my Southern friends just disowned me,

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:39.060 size:84% position:42% line:92%
but I'm cool with that.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:39.893 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- I was gonna say!

00:08:39.893 --> 00:08:40.726 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs)

00:08:40.726 --> 00:08:41.559 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- It's fine.

00:08:41.559 --> 00:08:42.392 line:92%
- She's gone full Hollywood!

00:08:42.392 --> 00:08:44.280 line:92%
- Yes, exactly, I'm so L.A. with my tea.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:46.380 line:92%
So, you have have thoughts on Valentine's Day, I hear.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.213 size:81% position:41% line:92%
- [Whitney] Well, yes.

00:08:47.213 --> 00:08:48.930 line:92%
Valentine's Day is coming up very soon.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.388 line:92%
And I feel like every year guys screw it up!

00:08:51.388 --> 00:08:54.410 line:92%
(audience laughs and cheers)

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.357 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Looking at you.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.270 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Not the park guy.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.110 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Not the park guy.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:00.950 line:92%
So, I have some ideas for guys that

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.420 line:92%
are watching the show that want some advice.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.385 size:84% position:42% line:92%
So, where am I looking?

00:09:04.385 --> 00:09:05.218 line:92%
Oh, I'm gonna look into here.

00:09:05.218 --> 00:09:06.706 line:92%
The guy up there, I'm looking at you, sir!

00:09:06.706 --> 00:09:08.055 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:09:08.055 --> 00:09:09.045 size:75% position:38% line:92%
If you're buying a--

00:09:09.045 --> 00:09:09.878 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(cymbal crashes)

00:09:09.878 --> 00:09:11.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:09:11.452 --> 00:09:15.119 line:92%
(band plays romantic music)

00:09:16.854 --> 00:09:18.841 line:92%
- [Kelly] No one warned you!

00:09:18.841 --> 00:09:20.694 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No one warned you!

00:09:20.694 --> 00:09:23.795 line:92%
All of a sudden my band just really wanted to be a part.

00:09:23.795 --> 00:09:24.828 line:92%
So they just started playing.

00:09:24.828 --> 00:09:25.881 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Oh my God!

00:09:25.881 --> 00:09:27.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh God, okay!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.830 line:92%
- We are playing music under your PSA!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:30.670 size:75% position:38% line:92%
- [Whitney] Oh Geez!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.503 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:09:31.503 --> 00:09:32.614 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay, all right.

00:09:32.614 --> 00:09:33.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Woo!

00:09:33.447 --> 00:09:34.280 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm sweating!

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.163 line:92%
Look, I'm sweating now, look!

00:09:35.163 --> 00:09:35.996 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:09:35.996 --> 00:09:36.829 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- [Kelly] You are!

00:09:36.829 --> 00:09:38.700 line:92%
Ah, you can't see, it's black!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.230 line:92%
- Okay, advice for the guys.

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.761 line:92%
You ready, goatee in the back?

00:09:41.761 --> 00:09:42.594 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You ready?

00:09:42.594 --> 00:09:44.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughing)

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:44.853 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
All right.

00:09:44.853 --> 00:09:48.000 line:92%
If you're buying ladies a gift for Valentine's Day,

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.030 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
get a gift card!

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:50.920 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I know, it's impersonal!

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.230 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Get a gift card!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.451 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I promise you,

00:09:53.451 --> 00:09:54.284 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience cheers)

00:09:54.284 --> 00:09:55.267 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I promise you.

00:09:57.161 --> 00:09:59.650 line:92%
I promise you, it'll be less of a fight

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:02.293 line:92%
than buying something in the wrong size.

00:10:02.293 --> 00:10:04.442 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience applause)

00:10:04.442 --> 00:10:07.630 line:92%
Also, if you're buying something for your girlfriend

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:11.910 line:92%
of two or more years, and decide to buy her jewelry

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:15.870 line:92%
that's not an engagement ring, I suggest you give her

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.802 line:92%
that jewelry box wearing a helmet!

00:10:17.802 --> 00:10:19.920 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience laughs)

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.063 line:92%
'Cause you're about to get concussed, sir.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.383 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Godspeed!

00:10:25.383 --> 00:10:26.216 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(audience cheers)

00:10:26.216 --> 00:10:27.049 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- See?

00:10:27.049 --> 00:10:27.882 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you.

00:10:27.882 --> 00:10:28.715 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Godspeed.

00:10:28.715 --> 00:10:29.548 size:78% position:39% line:92%
- Thank you, Whitney!

00:10:29.548 --> 00:10:30.381 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Good luck!

00:10:30.381 --> 00:10:31.214 line:92%
- [Kelly] Thank you for that PSA!

00:10:31.214 --> 00:10:34.400 line:92%
The best part was like, two years?

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.171 line:92%
Wear a helmet, 'cause she gonna beat you beat you--

00:10:36.171 --> 00:10:38.017 line:92%
- When guys after two years are like,

00:10:38.017 --> 00:10:39.570 line:92%
"Here's a necklace," outta here.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.496 size:78% position:39% line:92%
- [Kelly] Outta here!

00:10:40.496 --> 00:10:41.329 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
- Outta here.

00:10:41.329 --> 00:10:42.162 line:92%
- [Kelly] You take that jewelry and shove it!

00:10:42.162 --> 00:10:42.995 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
(laughs)

00:10:42.995 --> 00:10:44.440 line:92%
Bless your heart! - Bless your heart!

